 "raw_output": "**Nike had the higher gross margin in fiscal 2025, by about 24.7 percentage points.**\n\nGross margin is gross profit divided by revenue. For Nike, fiscal 2025 is the year ended May 31, 2025; for Tesla, it is the year ended December 31, 2025.\n\n- **Nike:** $19,790M gross profit \u00f7 $46,309M revenue = about 42.73%.\n- **Tesla:** $17,094M gross profit \u00f7 $94,827M revenue = about 18.03%.\n\nThe difference is 42.73% \u2212 18.03% = about 24.71 percentage points.\n\n{\"value\": 24.7, \"unit\": \"percentage_points\", \"choice\": \"NKE\", \"status\": \"answered\"}",
